# Orchestration

For non-trivial work in this folder, start with **`.cursor/skills/using-cs-skills/SKILL.md`** and load only the skills you need.

| Kind of work | Skill(s) |
|--------------|----------|
| Research / STRATEGY / resource | mm-research-analyst |
| Plan + slices + review | lead-engineer |
| Rust bot | mm-rust-engineer, cex-mm |
| mm-core math | tdd-workflow-mm |
| Testnet / recorder | testnet-ops |
| Keys / auth / logs | security-mm |
| Before “done” | verification-loop |
